# Prevent Git for Windows from mangling binary assets via autocrlf line-ending
# conversion. Without this, compressed/binary formats like .woff2 can get
# silently corrupted on commit (CRLF/LF byte-stripping), producing files that
# fetch fine over HTTP but fail to parse as valid fonts/images in the browser.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pdf binary
